{
    "title": "Local Weather & News - Radar",
    "description": "Weather & News app offers accurate hourly and daily forecasts, live radar, severe weather warnings, rainfall tracker and local & international news.\r\nDo you find it difficult to know how hot or cold the day is? Are there any weather alerts or storm/rainfall updates for my area? What about weather or traffic? What important events are happening nearby? No matter where you are, the weather app can provide you with accurate weather forecast information and news. You can view detailed local and global weather report in the app. Don't worry about sudden rain, and tornadoes, we will let you know ahead with our live radar maps and rainfall tracker. Prepare for floods, strong winds, freezing rain, and hurricanes. We provide Weather & News based on your current location automatically.\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Real-time weather\r\nUpdate weather conditions every minute, check the latest and accurate 24-hour forecast at any time. Be up to date at all times with Weather & News free app! Always know whether the sun will be out, a thunderstorm is approaching, if it\u2019ll rain, hail or snow. This app will accurately display current weather conditions for your exact position in any location worldwide.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Free weather radar map\r\nTrack the rain pathway: how it moved the past 2 hours, the current situation, and the forecast of where it will be moving in the next 30 minutes. With the help of the weather satellite map, you can check it more intuitively.\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Severe weather alert\r\nThis climate app can also turn into a global weather tracker and it can send you severe climate alerts to help you get prepared for upcoming weather changes.\r\n\r\n\u00b7 24-hour weather forecasts\r\nBefore you go out, you can check this free weather app to get prepared for unexpected changes. In addition, you can also check the hourly temperature and rain probability to plan your outdoor activities.\r\n\r\n\u00b7 14-day weather forecast\r\nThis app provides you accurate local weather information which includes 24-hour and 14-day forecast and timely alerts. There are also temperature in Celsius and Fahrenheit, atmospheric pressure, visibility distance, relative humidity, precipitation, dew point, ultraviolet index, wind speed and direction. It's your personal companion in this app that helps you prepare for upcoming severe weather conditions, you'll never be caught without an umbrella or snow boots again.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Weather details\r\nHourly and daily weather forecast in detail provide important information on wind, pressure, ultraviolet index, and tips to stay safe.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Latest news from local area\r\nThis app is not just about the weather. In this temperature checker, you can get the latest news covering society, entertainment, and sports.\r\nThis app helps people live safer, more vibrant and truly connected lives. Whether it\u2019s your local sports team, lifestyle tips or headlines... all delivered by top global and national media outlets.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Trusted news sources\r\nWeather & news\u2019s content discovery engine aggregates thousands of trusted sources. Browse news at any time, any location!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer (For publishers)\r\nWeather & Newss is an RSS feeds aggregator, its main goal is to make getting fresh content easier and help publishers to reach a larger audience. If you are a news publisher, please read this:\r\nTo contact us by email: easemobileteam@gmail.com\r\n\u2022 If your website is listed in our apps, this means that we are using your RSS feeds, we think a fair use is beneficial for you and our users. But if you want us to remove your website just contact us and we will do as soon as possible.\r\n\u2022 If your website is listed and you want it to be a trusted source in our app, which will give you more visibility and traffic, please contact us.\r\n\u2022 If your website, newspaper or blog is not listed, please contact us to add it, which will boost our products.\r\n*Web version: https://topfeed.info/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Weather &amp; News app offers accurate hourly and daily forecasts, live radar, severe weather warnings, rainfall tracker and local &amp; international news.<br>Do you find it difficult to know how hot or cold the day is? Are there any weather alerts or storm/rainfall updates for my area? What about weather or traffic? What important events are happening nearby? No matter where you are, the weather app can provide you with accurate weather forecast information and news. You can view detailed local and global weather report in the app. Don&#39;t worry about sudden rain, and tornadoes, we will let you know ahead with our live radar maps and rainfall tracker. Prepare for floods, strong winds, freezing rain, and hurricanes. We provide Weather &amp; News based on your current location automatically.<br>Key Features:<br><br>\u2022 Real-time weather<br>Update weather conditions every minute, check the latest and accurate 24-hour forecast at any time. Be up to date at all times with Weather &amp; News free app! Always know whether the sun will be out, a thunderstorm is approaching, if it\u2019ll rain, hail or snow. This app will accurately display current weather conditions for your exact position in any location worldwide.<br><br>\u2022 Free weather radar map<br>Track the rain pathway: how it moved the past 2 hours, the current situation, and the forecast of where it will be moving in the next 30 minutes. With the help of the weather satellite map, you can check it more intuitively.<br><br>\u00b7 Severe weather alert<br>This climate app can also turn into a global weather tracker and it can send you severe climate alerts to help you get prepared for upcoming weather changes.<br><br>\u00b7 24-hour weather forecasts<br>Before you go out, you can check this free weather app to get prepared for unexpected changes. In addition, you can also check the hourly temperature and rain probability to plan your outdoor activities.<br><br>\u00b7 14-day weather fore